    {
      "source": "In its very basic shape, the <code>KeyValueTemplate</code> uses a <code>MapAdapter</code> that wraps a <code>ConcurrentHashMap</code> and that uses <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/expressions.html\">Spring Expression Language</a> to run queries and sorting.",
      "translation": "在其最基本的结构中，<code>KeyValueTemplate</code> 使用一个包装了 <code>ConcurrentHashMap</code> 的 <code>MapAdapter</code>，并利用<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/expressions.html\">Spring 表达式语言</a>来执行查询和排序操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Running queries is managed by a <code>QueryEngine</code>.\nAs mentioned earlier, you can instruct the <code>KeyValueAdapter</code> to use an implementation-specific <code>QueryEngine</code> that allows access to native functionality.\nWhen used without further customization, queries can be run by using <code>SpELQueryEngine</code>.",
      "translation": "查询的执行由 `<code>QueryEngine</code>` 管理。  \n如前所述，您可以指示 `<code>KeyValueAdapter</code>` 使用特定实现的 `<code>QueryEngine</code>`，以访问原生功能。  \n在未进行额外自定义的情况下，可以使用 `<code>SpELQueryEngine</code>` 来执行查询。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Depending on the store implementation provided by the adapter, entities might already be stored in some sorted way but do not necessarily have to be.Again, the underlying <code>QueryEngine</code> is capable of performing sort operations.\nWhen used without further customization, sorting is done by using a <code>SpelPropertyComparator</code> extracted from the <code>Sort</code> clause.The following example shows a query with a <code>Sort</code> clause:",
      "translation": "根据适配器提供的存储实现，实体可能已经以某种排序方式存储，但并非必须如此。同样，底层的<code>QueryEngine</code>具备执行排序操作的能力。  \n在不进行额外自定义的情况下，排序是通过从<code>Sort</code>子句中提取的<code>SpelPropertyComparator</code>来完成的。以下示例展示了一个包含<code>Sort</code>子句的查询：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You can compose your own <code>KeySpace</code> annotations for a more domain-centric usage by annotating one of the attributes with <code>@AliasFor</code>.",
      "translation": "您可以通过使用 `<code>@AliasFor</code>` 注解其中一个属性，来自定义 `<code>KeySpace</code>` 注解，以实现更面向领域的用法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You can use a different type or pre-initialize the adapter with some values, and you can do so by using various constructors on <code>MapKeyValueAdapter</code>, as the following example shows:",
      "translation": "您可以使用不同类型的适配器，或者通过为适配器预初始化一些值来使用它。您可以通过在<code>MapKeyValueAdapter</code>上使用各种构造函数来实现这一点，如下面的示例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
