    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>Defines a custom <code>KeyValueOperations</code> bean using the default bean name. See documentation and properties of <code>@EnableMapRepositories</code> for further customization.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>Defines a custom <code>KeyValueAdapter</code> bean using a <code>ConcurrentHashMap</code> as storage that is used by <code>KeyValueTemplate</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>使用默认 bean 名称定义自定义的 <code>KeyValueOperations</code> bean。有关进一步自定义，请参阅 <code>@EnableMapRepositories</code> 的文档和属性。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>使用 <code>ConcurrentHashMap</code> 作为存储来定义自定义的 <code>KeyValueAdapter</code> bean，该存储由 <code>KeyValueTemplate</code> 使用。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>Returns all entities for the <code>persons</code> keyspace.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>Returns only elements of type <code>User</code> stored in <code>persons</code> keyspace.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>返回所有<code>persons</code>键空间中的实体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>仅返回存储在<code>persons</code>键空间中的<code>User</code>类型元素。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"anchor\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i></a>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/\">\n  Spring Security\n</a>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-authorization-server/reference/\">\n  Spring Authorization Server\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-ldap/reference/\">\n  Spring LDAP\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security-kerberos/reference/\">\n  Spring Security Kerberos\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-session/reference/\">\n  Spring Session\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-vault/reference/\">\n  Spring Vault\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<a class=\"anchor\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i></a>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/\">\n  Spring Security\n</a>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-authorization-server/reference/\">\n  Spring Authorization Server\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-ldap/reference/\">\n  Spring LDAP\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security-kerberos/reference/\">\n  Spring Security Kerberos\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-session/reference/\">\n  Spring Session\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-vault/reference/\">\n  Spring Vault\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-tip\" title=\"Tip\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n<code>@KeySpace</code> supports <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"value-expressions.html\">Value Expressions</a> allowing dynamic keyspace configuration.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-tip\" title=\"提示\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n<code>@KeySpace</code> 支持<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"value-expressions.html\">值表达式</a>，允许动态配置键空间。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nFor performance reasons, we highly recommend to make use of <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/expressions/evaluation.html#expressions-compiler-configuration\">compiled SpEL Expressions</a>.\n(“SpEL” is short for “Spring Expression Language”.) You can use the <code>-Dspring.expression.compiler.mode=IMMEDIATE</code> switch to enable it.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n出于性能考虑，我们强烈建议使用<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/expressions/evaluation.html#expressions-compiler-configuration\">编译后的 SpEL 表达式</a>。（“SpEL”是“Spring Expression Language”的缩写。）您可以使用<code>-Dspring.expression.compiler.mode=IMMEDIATE</code>开关来启用此功能。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nThe used <code>KeyValueAdapter</code> does the heavy lifting when it comes to storing and retrieving data.\nThe data structure influences performance and multi-threading behavior.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n在使用 <code>KeyValueAdapter</code> 进行数据存储和检索时，它承担了主要的计算工作。\n数据结构的选择会影响性能以及多线程行为。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nThe composed annotation must inherit <code>@Persistent</code>.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n组合注解必须继承 <code>@Persistent</code>。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nYou must have getters and setters present to query properties when you use SpEL.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n使用 SpEL 查询属性时，必须提供 getter 和 setter 方法。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nPlease note that you need to have getters and setters present to sort using SpEL.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n请注意，使用 SpEL 进行排序时，必须提供 getter 和 setter 方法。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
